Package: metaprep
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Extracting and Checking Model Fits
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person(
      given = "Alex",
      family = "Coppock",
      email = "acoppock@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Helper functions to prepare, extract, and inspect model fits
    in a tidy, reproducible way. Provides an estimates_vcov object that keeps
    coefficient estimates and their variance-covariance matrix synchronized
    through dplyr operations, which is useful for multi-arm meta-analysis
    workflows using 'metafor'.
